# Extreme: four lines typed fast (one every 80 ms, each a line more before the last has settled), then all taken back
# at once while the last is on its way: the composer and the rows over it as one.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 第一行
key shift+enter
wait 80
type 第二行
key shift+enter
wait 80
type 第三行
key shift+enter
wait 80
type 第四行
wait 120
clear
wait 900
exit
